.Sh VI MOTIONS
.Bd -literal -compact
Motions are vi normal commands that run in a [h v]range.
Commands described with the word "region" consume a region.
Motions can be prefixed or suffixed by [#].
.Ed
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact

.It Cm <^W> > < \&! c d y g~ gu gU
