.It Cm {\fI|\fP}{\fIcmd\fP}[\fI|\fP]
Ex subcommand structure
.It Cm {\fI>\fP}[\fIregex\fP][\fI>\fP]
Search forward structure
.It Cm {\fI<\fP}[\fIregex\fP][\fI<\fP]
Search backward structure
.It Cm '{\fI#mark\fP}
Mark structure

